    "detailed_description": "<br><br>The game offers extensive customization of your character in both modes Freemode and ArcadeMode, allowing you to choose from dozens of weapons, including swords, maces, shields and bows; different outfits and choose your own attack animations. All this will affect you both aesthetically and in your way of fighting.<br><br>Freemode will allow the players to build their own story in a vast world, where they can join guilds and player-lead factions, exploring the provinces while using a free building construction system, weapon creation, diplomacy and much more.<br><br>Arcade mode currently has FIVE game modes:<br>\u00b7 Team Deathmatch 2 to 4 Teams <br>\u00b7 Free For All<br>\u00b7 Capture the Flag<br>\u00b7 Last Team Standing 2 to 4 Teams<br>\u00b7 Defense<br><br>This modes can be played on four maps of different sizes, which will allow larger battles on larger maps.",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br>The game offers extensive customization of your character in both modes Freemode and ArcadeMode, allowing you to choose from dozens of weapons, including swords, maces, shields and bows; different outfits and choose your own attack animations. All this will affect you both aesthetically and in your way of fighting.<br><br>Freemode will allow the players to build their own story in a vast world, where they can join guilds and player-lead factions, exploring the provinces while using a free building construction system, weapon creation, diplomacy and much more.<br><br>Arcade mode currently has FIVE game modes:<br>\u00b7 Team Deathmatch 2 to 4 Teams <br>\u00b7 Free For All<br>\u00b7 Capture the Flag<br>\u00b7 Last Team Standing 2 to 4 Teams<br>\u00b7 Defense<br><br>This modes can be played on four maps of different sizes, which will allow larger battles on larger maps.",
    "short_description": "Blood Oath: When the Sword Rises has FreeMode and ArcadeMode, in which you will put yourself in the shoes of a medieval soldier who will take his course in an open world, fighting for your lord, the interests of your guild, or just engaging in small skirmishes with up to 32 players in ArcadeMode.",
    "supported_languages": "English, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Hungarian, Polish, German, Norwegian, Russian",
